  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/mod-titles/more-cartography-tables.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fsA42pp6cuX\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/discord.svg\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/pnk2u/More-Cartography-Tables\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/github.svg\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fpnku\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/pnku/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252flieonstudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/a-creation-by-lieon-studio.svg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/requires-quad.svg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h1>更多制图台</h1><p>用色彩斑斓的地图制作来装点你的建筑吧——现在每种木材都有专属的制图台了。</p><h5><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pnk2u/resources/main/ModProjects/More-Cartography-Tables/pres/cf_desc_banner.webp\" alt=\"\"></h5><p>一位来自沙漠村庄的制图师站在他收集的全部12种制图台变种前，每种上方都悬挂着相配的<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-torch-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多火把变种</a>。</p><h2>为Minecraft添加了11种新的制图台。</h2><hr><h1>与<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quad</a> 1.3.0+的方块替换功能兼容：</h1><p><img src=\"https://uwu.catgirl.host/i/szt4z.webp\" alt=\"\"><br>\n从制图师房屋望向沙漠村庄的农田：我们可以看到，游戏现在生成的村庄中，原本的<em>深色橡木制图台</em>、<em>橡木火把</em>和普通<em>堆肥桶</em>被替换成了<em><strong>丛林木制图台</strong></em>、<em><strong>丛林木火把</strong></em>（来自<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-torch-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多火把变种</a>）和<em><strong>丛林木堆肥桶</strong></em>（来自<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-composter-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多堆肥桶变种</a>）。</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>",
